     1	"""Same-machine EmbeddingGemma 2 discovery provider (AI-02).
     2	
     3	The default CTA path never imports this module's optional runtime. When local inference is
     4	explicitly enabled, the provider loads a permissively licensed ONNX text model from a local
     5	directory, embeds the eligible corpus in memory, and returns ordinary
     6	:class:`~app.domain.models.TraceCandidate` proposals. It has no writer: no accepted link,
     7	review state, evidence, or finding is created.
