     7	| Finding | Disposition | Evidence |
     8	|---|---|---|
     9	| **AI02-ACC-R1** — live checks used the wrong baseline | Repaired. Both live paths explicitly pass `baseline="baseline-a"` and derive `git` from `store.commit_of("baseline-a")`. The observed binding is `sha256:814eb991…`, matching baseline-a. | `bdd/support/cta_bridge.py`; `backend/tests/test_local_embedding_live.py`; SCN-3205; `AI-02-live-observations.json`. |
